2.
Definitions.
- In these rules unless there is anything repugnant to the subject or context-
(a)
"Act" means the Orissa Industrial Housing Act, 1966;
(b)
"agreement" means an agreement in Form 'C' appended to these rules;
(c)
"Chairman" means the Chairman of the Advisory Committee;
(d)
"Form" means a form appended to these rules;
(e)
"member" means a member of the Advisory Committee;
(f)
all other words and expressions used but not defined herein shall have the meaning as respectively assigned to them in
the Act.
